\hline
Model & Adapt. & ROC & FPR & ROC & FPR & ROC & FPR \\
\hline
Random Forest      & none & 0.966 & 0.027 & 0.980 & 0.138 & 0.999 & 0.003 \\
XGBoost            & none & 0.962 & 0.028 & 0.979 & 0.250 & 0.998 & 0.002 \\
MLP (sklearn)      & none & 0.920 & 0.052 & 0.972 & 0.325 & 0.996 & 0.005 \\
MLP (torch, node)  & none & 0.937 & 0.058 & 0.971 & 0.331 & 0.993 & 0.005 \\
Autoencoder        & none & 0.963 & 0.047 & 0.834 & 0.065 & 0.943 & 0.049 \\
Static GCN         & none & 0.834 & 0.075 & 0.931 & 0.353 & 0.846 & 0.055 \\
Static GAT         & none & 0.920 & 0.077 & 0.947 & 0.400 & 0.934 & 0.061 \\
GAT+LSTM           & none & 0.925 & 0.080 & 0.947 & 0.400 & 0.937 & 0.069 \\
GAT+LSTM           & incr.& 0.889 & 0.121 & 0.947 & 0.184 & 0.967 & 0.113 \\
